lines:
This Pokémon won the Beauty Contest
here before.{be01}
Well, guess what? Today, I made it
win a Smartness Contest!{be01}
My abilities scare even me...

我多次参加过华丽大赛，所以比较了
解这里的规则。如果你参加帅气大{be01}
赛，帅气的招式才会吸引人，相对
地，聪明的招式或可爱的招式等等就{be01}
吸引不了别人。

Ayayayay...
I entered the wrong Contest.{be01}
I entered this tough Pokémon in the
Smartness Contest...{be01}
Come on, wow them with a smart-looking
Rock Smash.

Waaaah!{be01}
I brushed and groomed my Pokémon
carefully for this Contest...{be01}
But I overdid it...
My Pokémon’s coat turned all scraggly...{be01}
What should I do?

Everyone’s Pokémon are very cute.{be01}
However, if my Pokémon were to make
a cute appeal...{be01}
I’m sure that it would be so much 
cuter than the others.
